 point='<b>"Four" seven times.</b> Four arms, four vyūhas, four āśramas (stages of life), four puruṣārthas (dharma, artha, kāma, mokṣa), four Vedas. Then <b>Ekapāt (772)</b>: the Puruṣa Sūkta says the whole universe is only one quarter of Him; three quarters are beyond.',
