 point='<b>Bhārabhṛt (847).</b> "Bearer of the burden": He carries the weight of the worlds, and the weight of His devotees. In the Gītā (9.22): "I carry what they lack and keep what they have". <b>Āśrama (852)</b>: like a hermitage, He is a shelter for the weary.',
